{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06978","headline":"茱萸女 · 万楚","name":"茱萸女","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山阴柳家女，九日采茱萸。\n复得东邻伴，双爲陌上姝。\n插枝着高髻，结子置长裾。\n作性常迟缓，非关诧丈夫。\n平明折林樾，日入返城隅。\n侠客要罗袖，行人挑短书。\n蛾眉自有主，年少莫踟蹰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}